<title>HONG KONG: BA's HK manager Li quits.</title>
<headline>BA's HK manager Li quits.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways Plc said on Tuesday its Hong Kong manager, Freddy Li, will leave the airline to join Qantas Airways Ltd at the end of January 1997.</p>
<p>Qantas was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Australian carrier Qantas is 25 percent owned by British Airways.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
